From 876f0e14fd3eeff628516fbc84bef8202f6adac7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UML Android bring-up <uml@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 04:18:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] drm/vkms: export frames to the host on UML, optional
 fixed mode

vkms.export=<host file> makes vkms compose every committed frame and
write it as RGBA into a host file mapped with uml_map_host_file(), so a
viewer outside UML can show the display. A 4 KiB header carries the size
and a sequence counter that is odd while a frame is being written.
Frames are composed once per commit, not on every vblank.

vkms.width=/vkms.height= replace the mode list with a single mode of
that size, for example a portrait phone display.
